    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68017" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισθοφορ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mercenary</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυνάμεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.67.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ μισθοφόροι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Art.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; also, <i>the pay of mercenaries</i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				12.2.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. γῆ</span> land <i>assigned to</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισθοφόροι</span>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.604<i>B</i>248
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					4.51
				</span></i>
			.</div>
